sequenceDiagram
    participant Guest as Guest (User)
    participant Frontend as Next.js App
    participant Backend as FastAPI API

    Guest->>Frontend: Navigates to Home Page (/)

    par Auth Check and Initial Data Load
        Frontend->>Backend: GET /api/users/me
        alt User is NOT Authenticated (Guest)
            Backend-->>Frontend: Returns 401 Unauthorized
        else User IS Authenticated
            Backend-->>Frontend: Returns User object { id, username, ... }
        end
    and
        Frontend->>Backend: GET /api/subjects/top
        Backend-->>Frontend: Returns list of top subjects
    and
        Frontend->>Backend: GET /api/guides/top
        Backend-->>Frontend: Returns list of top guides
    end

    Frontend-->>Guest: Renders the full Home Page
    Note over Frontend, Guest: Navbar shows "Auth" & "Profile" buttons. <br/> Page displays top subjects and top guides.